  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "\"The devil lives in our house.\"\n\nYeong-Cheol is an artist specialising in oil painting whose talent is recognised at home and abroad. His wife is a singer, and his son Hwan-Hui is a painting prodigy. Yeong-Cheol looks even more perfect with a seemingly perfect family... \n\nHowever, as Hwan-Hui grows, Yeong-Cheol feels as though his son is trying to take his place. His anxiety grows when Hwan-Hui takes charge of the main painting for the joint exhibition they're preparing for together. \n\nSeeing Hwan-Hui's aggressive expression, Yeong-Cheol decides to provoke his son into showing his true intentions using hostility, hoping to protect his position.\n\n(Source: Kakao Webtoon, translated)",
